     5: * Top-level screens are reached from the nav, the top bar or Home; their back button says "Home" and goes Home.
     6: * Every other senior screen is drilled down into; its back button says "Back" and returns to where it was opened from.
     7: */
     8:export const TOP_LEVEL_SCREENS: readonly Screen[] = ["cover", "dedication", "home", "health", "milestones", "walk", "settings"];
